WEBVTT

00:18.680 --> 00:20.080
Brother-in-law.

00:21.240 --> 00:23.907
Can't let everyone's morale keep falling like this.

00:25.280 --> 00:27.280
We need to take a gamble.

00:30.640 --> 00:33.760
Night raid night raid.

00:35.480 --> 00:40.480
I bet Shilang doesn't take us seriously enough yet bet he won't expect.

00:40.600 --> 00:44.027
That we'd dare in this situation to raid his main camp.

00:48.400 --> 00:53.720
That's a plan although the enemy has ten times our forces but facing a surprise attack.

00:53.800 --> 00:58.480
They'll actually struggle with deployment and be unable to respond in time the key to a raid.

00:58.560 --> 01:00.893
Is to avoid the enemy's main force.

01:04.960 --> 01:10.360
The Wuzhao drove refugees to attack the city that evening I saw the eastern enemy camp rising smoke early.

01:10.800 --> 01:16.800
While the western enemy camp is near the river brother-in-law where do you think the enemy's main force.

01:16.880 --> 01:18.280
Should be hiding?

01:19.120 --> 01:23.267
Looking at the Wuzhao's camp arrangement the main force should be.

